{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17side_level_act17side_st03",
  "groupId": "act17side",
  "stageId": "act17side_03",
  "title": "空旷的大街",
  "storyCode": "SN-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "69b986771bcf406d9ca650e960b2aab5a389662ce2a6688d64965814b7f37494",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艾丽妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸？啊，我在，老师......不，长官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......我没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "格兰法洛只是一座小镇，在很多地图上也许都找不到的小镇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "即使如此，这也是卡门阁下的委托，与凯尔希医生和那几个阿戈尔人都有关联。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道，长官，所以我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你还得不出答案，我不允许你同行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "选择成为审判官跟随长官的时候，我就已经做好了准备！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你得出的答案还无法诠释你之前的所见所闻，就更不要简单得出结论。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不要白白送死，艾丽妮。你已经明白我们对抗的是什么，你必须得出你自己的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我明白了，长官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "凯尔希女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂娅的语调没有变化，但她的脚步能够反映出她的心情。\n只消一瞬，风发出声响所需的时间，她就来到了凯尔希的身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "辛苦了，歌蕾蒂娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "审判庭似乎没有对你做什么，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "伊比利亚还没有沉没，这就是他们尚存些微谦卑与警觉的证明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你找到办法了，如我们所约定的那样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "是的。但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......如果伊比利亚愿意放下他们所担忧的，那阿戈尔呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果我们别无他路......而短暂的合作能帮助我们回到海洋，我愿意合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "总算有个像样的阿戈尔人了，对吧？就像浪涛本身，就像海洋的光线与触感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你好啊，特别的阿戈尔人。我想你已经见过我们的其他成员了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的，那么，您也是日落即逝的成员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "贝斯手Alty。很高兴见到你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "外面怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那些深海教徒倾巢而出，数量不少，但很弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "猎人们足以处理所有问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "解决格兰法洛的问题后，审判庭才会与我们合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那就让我们立刻开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂娅提起了她的长槊。\n可几乎与此同时，她感到了某种异样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......不，这些恐鱼中混杂着......不可能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "凯尔希医生！他们的目的是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......极境？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我们的干员遇到了危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有什么潜藏在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......Alty，就像我们说的那样。日落即逝的各位，只要留在岸上就足够。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我们会尽快解决问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好啊，我们等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你们的征途需要一些音乐点缀的话，那我们更乐意效劳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......太弱了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "它们这样前仆后继，就像在拖延时间......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......又或者，它们是在......散播什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "得找出它们的头儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——嘎——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "幽灵鲨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊......你在这里，斯卡蒂。好久不见了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有什么事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......你还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很好，只是，有些困。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......我们在战斗，对吧，这些海洋的气息......总让人想起......故乡的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是，故乡？我的故乡......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘎——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "海的气味越来越浓烈，斯卡蒂，我们回家了吗？这里是回家的路吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......会是的，幽灵鲨，劳伦缇娜，我保证。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那请告诉我......我眼前的又是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "眼前？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人影从街道那头走来，轻哼着旋律。\n镇民的慌乱留给街道一片狼藉，可年轻的Frost眼中仿若无物。她拨弄着空气，想象着音乐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐鱼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（摇动的窸窣声）——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "......恐鱼没有靠近她，不，就像她不存在一样......她那是在弹琴吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好听吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那不如问问她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈啊、哈啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（没跟上来......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......坏了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "难道是刚见面的时候......不是吧，我都闪开了啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......伊比利亚人，那些资料必须销毁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你可以四肢健全地服从我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（该死，这家伙动作怎么这么快......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......真奇怪，你的同伴是匆忙撤离才不得不烧掉这些文件的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你有这样的身手，抢回去带走不是更省事？执着于烧掉做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "同伴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人低吟了片刻，某种声响在他的喉间蠕动，那是一种屈辱导致的沙哑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们......不是同伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "与你无关......你只要交出那些文件，然后离开这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "无论你是审判庭的人，还是其他国家的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（怎么停下了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊......你们一向那么敏锐。一直都是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这个神秘的阿戈尔人目视着某个方向。\n“同伴”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（阿戈尔语）我们血脉相连，可现在，你们必须远离阿戈尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "极境避开了。可是他也在此刻明白，自己为什么能避开。\n那些还泛着焦黑的纸张被剑气掀起，真相碎成无数，在半空中飘落零散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "糟糕——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（阿戈尔语）她们还不能回到阿戈尔，再放任所有人一意孤行，只会加速阿戈尔的毁灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（阿戈尔语）尽管阿戈尔早已选择了......自取灭亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没有恐鱼还在靠近了吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "地处海边，从数量而言，并不意外。你们都躲藏在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的教徒",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你......咳咳......那、那盏灯！把你的灯拿开......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "回答我。你们觊觎格兰法洛的什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的教徒",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "灯、灯！不，把这灯拿开......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "回答我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的教徒",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的教徒",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是......是那个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？你指着什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡门回过头去，顺着深海教徒所指的方向望去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一座雕塑。孤立在广场正中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "格兰法洛，灯塔。是，你们当然在格兰法洛寻找灯塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的教徒",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "停下......停下你的法术......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这些工业的宏伟造物曾被贵族们称赞为“伊比利亚之眼”。过去，伊比利亚的海岸边有数十座这样的灯塔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哪怕莱塔尼亚的巫王高塔没有被摧毁，也无法与这些看守海洋的巨物媲美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "它们是人类文明留在这片大地上的最伟大的痕迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的教徒",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "海洋......咳咳......伊比利亚之眼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的教徒",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "神迹......彻底毁掉了那些亵渎之物......呃啊......拿走你的灯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大静谧摧毁了大多数灯塔，剩下的也几乎无法使用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们在盘算着什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的教徒",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "原来如此。你们知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们知道还有最后一座灯塔可以投入使用，你们知道，格兰法洛所有计划的最终目的就是保护那座伊比利亚之眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以你们盘踞在这里，等待时机？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的教徒",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "连审判庭的中枢里都有叛徒，这是我没有预料到的。他们在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的教徒",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......哼......哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的教徒",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在你......喋喋不休的时候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的教徒",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看看你的脚下吧......再一次认识到......你们有多么的狭隘......可悲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "濒死的恐鱼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "濒死的恐鱼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......（令人不安的窸窣声）......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这些恐鱼的身体......在发光？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这些光斑是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "卡门阁下，请远离！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣徒卡门",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Mon3tr！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（不耐烦的低鸣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "熔毁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（激昂的咆哮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（一段平稳的独奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你身上......有熟悉的气息。你知道那是什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（一段激昂的独奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......美妙的旋律，但与我所知的大不相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......那，你所知的是什么样的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "当她祈祷，星星停止闪烁♪\n当她流泪，夜晚露出微笑♪\n当她悲叹，痛苦蔓延在她的疯狂♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......阿戈尔的歌。哀伤的歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可我不喜欢。它属于过去，它放下了热情，徒劳感伤。和阿戈尔一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "阿戈尔人，你回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "回家？我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "歌唱吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是你找回自己的办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "歌唱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......能靠歌唱回想起什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唱吧，你会遇见你的过去。你迟早要面对你的命运，或是让命运找上你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我离开海洋之后，就一直如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......奇怪的人。但是，歌唱，我不讨厌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那就歌唱吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼哼，哼哼哼♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当她祈祷，星星停止闪烁♪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......还是这样让人悲伤的歌声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是......谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿玛雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没想到我们会在这样的情况下再见，劳伦缇娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
